tors in lifted observable feature spaces.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KoopmanOperator","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftForecast\/documentation\/SwiftForecast\/KoopmanOperator","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KoopmanOperator","kind":"identifier"}]}}}